{"id":"proce_dure","lemma":"procédure","pos":"noun","rank":1873,"glosses":["procedure"],"ipa":"/pʁɔ.se.dyʁ/","audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/7/76/Fr-proc%C3%A9dure.ogg/Fr-proc%C3%A9dure.ogg.mp3","gender":"f","forms":{"plural":"procédures"},"formAudio":{"procédures":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/6/62/LL-Q150_%28fra%29-Eihel-proc%C3%A9dures.wav"},"examples":[{"text":"Je connais la procédure.","en":"I know the procedure.","words":[{"g":"I"},{"g":"to know","l":"connaître"},{"g":"the / her"},null]},{"text":"La procédure est-elle claire ?","en":"Is the procedure clear?","words":[{"g":"the / her"},null,{"g":"is","l":"être"},{"g":"she / it"},{"g":"clear","l":"clair"}]},{"text":"Je lui ai expliqué les procédures.","en":"I explained the process to him.","words":[{"g":"I"},{"g":"him, he, it"},{"g":"have","l":"avoir"},{"g":"to explain","l":"expliquer"},{"g":"the / them","l":"le"},null]},{"text":"Tu ne comprends pas la procédure.","en":"You don't understand the procedure.","words":[{"g":"you"},{"g":"not"},{"g":"to understand","l":"comprendre"},{"g":"not"},{"g":"the / her"},null]},{"text":"Pourriez-vous décrire ces procédures ?","en":"Could you describe those procedures?","words":[{"g":"can, to be able to","l":"pouvoir"},{"g":"you"},{"g":"to describe"},{"g":"it, this, that","l":"ce"},null]}]}